OL,3,GNEWSATest 'would've prevented
OL,4,Aexplosion', court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas expert from the UK has said if a
OL,7,Ftest which checks for leaking gas had
OL,8,Fbeen done an explosion at a block of
OL,9,Fflats, which killed ten people, would
OL,10,Fnot have happened.
OL,12,FChris Clarke is giving evidence in the
OL,13,Ftrial of gas workers Neil Armstrong,
OL,14,FJohn Wright and Lee Ward who deny 10
OL,15,Fcounts of gross negligence
OL,16,Fmanslaughter.
OL,18,FIn a combined case, Island Energy has
OL,19,Fpleaded not guilty to health and safety
OL,20,Fbreaches.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
