OL,3,GNEWSATest 'would've prevented
OL,4,Aexplosion', court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe workers were excavating gas pipes
OL,7,Fon the road below the Haut du Mont
OL,8,Fflats that serviced the area of La
OL,9,FCollette - including the flats - on 9
OL,10,FDecember 2022, the day before the
OL,11,Fexplosion.
